{"id":"chatcmpl-b9c78414-5cc8-41f0-9b15-fa5d781b4bbe","object":"chat.completion","created":1795250614,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"The task required distinguishing between left and right pleural effusion in a chest X-ray. The successful strategy involved querying a specialized expert tool for laterality and cross-validating with a grounded localization tool, then confirming against image markers. This pattern of using multiple independent sources to resolve spatial ambiguity is generalizable to similar medical image interpretation tasks.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When options differ only by laterality (left vs. right), explicitly query tools for the side of the finding rather than relying on general descriptions.\",\n    \"Use two independent tools (e.g., expert interpretation and grounded localization) to confirm the same spatial attribute, reducing error from single-source bias.\",\n    \"Cross-check tool outputs against visible image markers (e.g., 'L' or 'R') to validate anatomical orientation.\",\n    \"For binary choice questions with symmetric options, focus the reasoning on the discriminating feature (here, laterality) and ignore irrelevant details.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical image interpretation\": \"Always verify laterality using both expert opinion and localization tools; confirm with image markers.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice with symmetric options\": \"Identify the key discriminating attribute (e.g., side, size, location) and query tools specifically for that attribute.\",\n    \"Tool-assisted decision making\": \"Use at least two independent tools for critical spatial attributes and reconcile their outputs before answering.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that the tool outputs agree on the laterality of the finding.\",\n    \"Verify that the image marker (e.g., 'L' or 'R') matches the reported side.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":473,"total_tokens":808,"completion_tokens":335,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":473},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":335}}}